<title>SPAIN: Spain regional debt up 2.2 pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>Spain regional debt up 2.2 pct in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's regional governments increased their public debt in the first quarter of 1997 to 8.68 trillion pesetas up 2.2 percent from 8.49 trillion at the end of 1996, a Bank of Spain study showed.</p>
<p>During 1996, regional debt had risen 11.4 percent.</p>
<p>Following is a detailed table of regional debt:</p>
